I think you split with Carol because you had one very similar interest.
我認為你跟她分開的原因 就是因為有相同的興趣

18
00:01:05,390 --> 00:01:08,290
I'm gonna finish this later, okay? Let me just grab my coat.
我等一下再寫好了 讓我拿一件外套

19
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:10,560
Okay!
好的

20
00:01:13,030 --> 00:01:17,030
What, did you think you learned how to do it in the last two minutes?
怎樣？你認為你花了兩分鐘 就能學會嗎？

21
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:24,310
Maybe we finish this for him.
