- I don't have a page. - Oh, I respectfully disagree!
-我沒有網頁 -喔，我真心表示無法苟同！

81
00:05:55,150 --> 00:05:57,080
Huggsy?
哈吉？

82
00:05:57,250 --> 00:05:58,450
Huggsy?
哈吉？

83
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:00,420
Huggsy.
哈吉

84
