沒關係！沒關係，瑞秋 是我，把發卷放下來

90
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:44,500
- What are you doing? - Well, I heard Emma stirring..
-你在做什麼？ -喔，我聽到艾□的聲音

91
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:48,190
so I came in to make sure she could reach Huggsy.
所以我過來確定一下 讓她可以抓到哈吉

92
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:52,930
Oh, thanks. All right, well, now that I'm up, I'm gonna go to the bathroom.
