And I know that's not what you want.
我知道，那不是你想要的

138
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:55,080
All right, so give me your phone.
好了，把電話給我

139
00:09:55,390 --> 00:09:57,220
Here.
拿去

140
00:09:57,590 --> 00:10:01,650
- And now your cell. - Okay.
-還有你的手機 -好吧

141
00:10:05,670 --> 00:10:08,030
There you go.
拿去

142
