145
00:10:27,090 --> 00:10:30,580
Phoebe? Where's your purse?
菲比？你的皮包呢？

146
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:33,690
- Hey! No! - No!
-嘿，不行 -不！

147
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,620
