-菲比，過來！ -不！

151
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:47,470
- Give it to me! - You're crazy!
-給我！ -你瘋了！

152
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:53,040
Damn you, Monica Geller hyphen Bing!
去你的，摩妮卡蓋勒—賓！

153
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:59,280
Don't even think of sneaking out and using a pay phone..
別想要偷跑出去打公用電話

154
00:10:59,450 --> 00:11:02,150
because I am everywhere, baby!
因為我無所不在，寶貝！

155
00:11:05,230 --> 00:11:10,430
Hey, look who's here. It's Joey. And he brought home a friend.
嘿，瞧瞧是誰來了，是喬伊 而且他帶新朋友來了

156
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:14,760
Emma's right here. You promised not to bring girls home in the middle of the day!
艾□在這裡，你答應不會在白天 帶女生回來的

157
00:11:14,970 --> 00:11:17,870
No, no, no, it's not a girl. It's..
不、不、不，不是女生，是…

158
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:20,770
a brand-new Huggsy!
全新的哈吉！

159
00:11:20,980 --> 00:11:24,240
Oh! Oh, that's so great! Now Emma has two Huggsies!
喔！這真是太棒了！ 現在艾□有兩個哈吉了

160
00:11:24,450 --> 00:11:28,470
No, no. Oh, no. No, Emma has one Huggsy.
不、不，喔不 不，艾□只有一個哈吉

161
00:11:28,650 --> 00:11:30,380
The new Huggsy.
新的哈吉

162
00:11:30,550 --> 00:11:34,110
The other Huggsy, I don't know, I guess I'll just take him back.
另外那個哈吉，我不知道 我想我就把他拿回去好了

163
00:11:34,290 --> 00:11:39,160
You know what? When I was a little girl, I had a little pink pony named Cotton.
你知道嗎？當我還是小女孩的時候 我有一隻粉紅色的小馬，叫小棉花

164
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:43,820
Oh, I loved her so much. I took her everywhere. I would braid her tail..
喔，我好愛她，去哪我都帶著她 我會梳她的尾巴…

165
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,970
Make the transfer!
快點移交吧！

166
00:11:50,070 --> 00:11:54,060
Should I be concerned that a button fell off the old Huggsy and I can't find it?
舊哈吉身上有個鈕扣不見了，我找不到 有沒有關係？

167
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:58,180
No, don't worry about it. I swallowed that years ago. Hey!
不，不用擔心 很多年前被我吞下去了，嘿！

168
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:03,010
Oh, what? I don't think she likes the new Huggsy.
喔，怎麼了？我想她不喜歡新哈吉

169
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:06,080
- But he's the same. - I think she wants the old one back.
-但他是一樣的啊 -我想她要舊的哈吉

170
00:12:06,290 --> 00:12:09,280
- Yeah, but he's the same. - Joey, come on.
-是喔，但他們一模一樣啊 -喬伊，拿來

171
00:12:09,490 --> 00:12:12,120
But he's the same!
根本是一樣的嘛！

172
00:12:14,730 --> 00:12:17,290
You're not the same.
你不一樣啦

173
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:23,530
You know, it's a lot less surprising to do that..
你這樣嚇不到我…

174
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:26,000
after I've buzzed you into the building.
因為是我按開樓下的門讓你進來的

175
00:12:27,310 --> 00:12:30,640
So, Phoebe, why are there men's shoes by the door?
菲比，為什麼門邊有男人的鞋子呢？

176
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,910
Those are my shoes.
那是我的鞋子

177
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:37,210
Well, when you get over this breakup, we need to go shopping.
嗯，當你復元之後，我們一定要去血拼

178
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:40,840
Look, Monica, I really appreciate you checking in on me.
聽著，摩妮卡 我真的很感激你這樣關心我

179
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:43,490
- But I'm actually feeling a lot better. - You are?
-但是我已經覺得好多了 -真的？

180
00:12:43,660 --> 00:12:46,090
Yeah, I just kind of want to be alone right now.
是的，我只是有點想自己獨處

181
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:52,860
- Who's that? - I ordered Chinese food.
-是誰啊？ -我叫了中餐外送

182
00:12:55,070 --> 00:12:58,100
What are the chances?!
真是太巧了

183
00:12:58,410 --> 00:13:02,240
One billion Chinese people, and they send Mike!
在十億的中國人當中 他們竟然派麥克來！

184
00:13:05,210 --> 00:13:07,510
- What are you doing here? - Phoebe called me.
-你來這裡做什麼呢？ -菲比打電話給我

185
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:10,310
- Phoebe! - I'm sorry. I broke down.
-菲比！ -我很抱歉，我受不了

186
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,780
I wanted to see him.
我想要見他

187
00:13:11,950 --> 00:13:13,820
Well, not on my watch.
在我的監視之下不准

188
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:16,920
Damn it, Phoebe, how did you even call him?
該死的，菲比 你是怎麼打電話給他的？

189
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:19,390
There's a speakerphone on the base unit.
電話主機有免持聽筒功能

190
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:24,630
Base unit. Think, Monica, think!
主機，用腦啊，摩妮卡，用用腦！

191
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:26,560
- Can I come in? - No! No.
-我可以進來嗎？ -不可以，不可以

192
00:13:26,730 --> 00:13:30,930
Phoebe, isn't seeing Mike exactly what you wanted me to stop you from doing?
菲比，你不是要我阻止你 跟麥克見面嗎？

193
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:35,540
- Look, if I want to see Phoebe, and she.. - This doesn't concern you!
-聽著，如果我想見菲比，而她… -這不關你的事！

194
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:40,280
Sorry. I guess I was thrown off by the mention of my name.
對不起，我只是聽到有人提到我的名字

195
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:44,250
Look, guys, you can't do this.
聽著，你們不能這樣做

196
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:46,820
It's gonna make getting over each other harder.
這會使事情更複雜的

197
00:13:47,020 --> 00:13:51,120
Not if nothing happens. Why can't we just hang out as friends?
如果什麼事都沒發生就不會 我們不能當朋友嗎？

198
00:13:52,660 --> 00:13:56,430
Sure. If you're just gonna hang out as friends, then maybe I'll join you.
當然可以，如果你們只是朋友 那我也可以加入你們

199
00:13:56,630 --> 00:13:59,390
You know, I'm your friend and Mike's friend.
你知道的，我是你的朋友 也是麥克的朋友

200
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:04,700
Sit down.
坐下吧

201
00:14:08,510 --> 00:14:10,530
Make room for your friend.
讓個位置給你們的朋友

202
00:14:20,590 --> 00:14:23,460
- So how have you been? - I've been pretty good.
-你過得好不好？ -我還挺不錯的

203
00:14:28,230 --> 00:14:32,190
- You look really beautiful. - Thanks. You look good too.
-你真的很美 -謝謝，你看起來也不錯

204
00:14:32,370 --> 00:14:37,100
No, no, no. This is dangerous territory. Keep it clean.
不對，這太危險了，放乾淨點

205
00:14:38,370 --> 00:14:40,000
So how's the piano playing going?
那鋼琴演奏還好嗎？

206
00:14:40,210 --> 00:14:43,540
Actually, I've been playing a lot of love songs lately.
事實上，我最近彈了許多情歌

207
00:14:43,710 --> 00:14:47,580
- I've missed you. - I've missed you too.
-我一直很想你 -我也是

208
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:55,350
You know, on the way over here, I saw this drunk guy throw up.
在我要過來這裡的路上 我看到一個酒鬼吐了一地

209
00:14:56,590 --> 00:14:59,390
And then a pigeon ate it.
然後一隻鴿子還去吃

210
00:15:03,300 --> 00:15:04,860
Hey. Ross.
嘿，羅斯

211
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:08,230
Look, I just wanted to apologize.
聽著，我只是想過來跟你道歉

212
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:12,370
Don't tell me you actually made those gay pictures of me.
別告訴我你真的在做我的同志照

213
00:15:13,070 --> 00:15:14,800
Check this out.
瞧瞧這個

214
00:15:15,010 --> 00:15:18,310
So that's what I'd look like if I worked out.
所以如果我有健身，看起來就會是這樣

215
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:22,540
And was being serviced by a policeman.
而且還有警察先生為我服務

216
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:24,880
You're not gonna actually send these out, are you?
你不是真的要貼出這些照片吧？

217
00:15:25,090 --> 00:15:29,040
Actually, I don't need to, because your little "Ross is dead" joke didn't work.
事實上，我沒有必要 因為「羅斯死了」的笑話根本沒用

218
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:30,990
Okay? There were no responses.
好嗎？根本就沒有人回應

219
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:35,750
Nobody posted anything, nobody called my parents, so the joke is on you.
沒有人張貼任何東西 沒有人打電話給我父母，你才好笑

220
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:40,990
Nobody called, nobody wrote anything, nobody cares that I'm dead.
沒有人來電，沒有人寫什麼 沒有人在乎我死了

221
00:15:44,870 --> 00:15:46,570
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

222
00:15:46,770 --> 00:15:50,400
- Nobody cares that I'm dead? - Oh, come on, you know that's not true.
-沒有人在乎我死了嗎？ -喔，別這樣，你知道不是那樣的

223
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:53,010
What are you talking about? You get 60 responses..
你在說什麼呢？你有六十個回覆

224
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:54,910
just for coming out of the closet.
只不過是因為出櫃而已

225
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:58,350
I didn't get one response, and I'm dead!
而我死了，卻連一個回覆都沒有！

226
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:02,920
Well, the gay community is a lot more vocal than the dead community.
嗯，同志社團比死人社團還要活躍

227
00:16:03,090 --> 00:16:09,030
I can't believe this. Not even my geology lab partner. And I carried that guy!
我不敢相信，連我地質學伴都沒有回覆 以前都是我罩他的！

228
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:11,090
Look, let's think about this, okay?
聽著，我們不要再多想了，好嗎？

229
00:16:11,270 --> 00:16:14,500
You think people are gonna disturb your family at this tragic time?
你認為大家會想要在 這悲傷的時刻打擾你的家人嗎？

230
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:17,400
That people are gonna post condolences on a website?
有人會在網站上張貼哀悼辭嗎？

231
00:16:17,570 --> 00:16:19,370
This isn't about people not caring.
不是說大家不在乎

232
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:24,530
This is about people not having a decent outlet for their grief.
而是那並非適合的抒發悲情的管道

233
00:16:24,710 --> 00:16:27,410
- You're right. There isn't a decent outlet. - Right.
-你說的沒錯，那不是適合的管道 -沒錯

234
00:16:27,610 --> 00:16:32,280
I'm sure if you had a funeral or memorial service, tons of people would come.
我確定如果你有舉辦追悼會 一定會有很多人來的

235
00:16:32,890 --> 00:16:35,250
Exactly!
沒錯！

236
00:16:36,060 --> 00:16:38,460
Ross, what are you doing?
羅斯，你要幹嘛？

237
00:16:38,630 --> 00:16:40,960
You're having a memorial service for yourself?
你要幫自己辦追悼會？

238
00:16:41,330 --> 00:16:45,530
No, that would be stupid. You're having it for me.
不，那會太離譜了，你要幫我辦

239
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:49,930
- Ross, don't press send. Don't press.. - No, too late. Too late. It's sent.
-羅斯，不要寄出，不要寄… -不，太遲了，太遲了，寄出了

240
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:53,340
Sorry, so is that picture of you and the policeman.
對不起，還有你 跟警察先生的照片也寄了

241
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:58,970
That's all right. I'm tan, limber..
沒關係，我曬的很黑又很健壯

242
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:02,120
And it looks like I talked my way out of that ticket.
看起來好像是我在求他不要開罰單

243
00:17:04,590 --> 00:17:07,520
The surgery was not a success. And then you say:
手術失敗後，你說：

244
00:17:07,690 --> 00:17:10,420
"What are we gonna do, Drake?"
「我們該怎麼辦，德克？」

245
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:19,630
Come in.
進來

246
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:24,270
I'm trying to put Emma down for a nap. Have you seen Huggsy?
我剛要哄艾□睡一下 你有看到哈吉嗎？

247
00:17:24,470 --> 00:17:26,410
Original or crappy?
原版的還是爛的？

248
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:30,270
- Original. - No. Sorry. Haven't seen him.
-原版的 -沒有，抱歉，沒有看到

249
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:33,670
Then what's that big lump under your covers?
那你床上突起來的是什麼？

250
00:17:34,450 --> 00:17:37,820
- It's Monica, okay? - That's not Monica!
-是摩妮卡，好嗎？ -那不是摩妮卡！

251
00:17:37,990 --> 00:17:41,390
All right, fine! It's original Huggsy!
好啦，沒關係！是原版的哈吉！

252
00:17:42,990 --> 00:17:45,550
I know Emma wants him, but he's mine and I need him.
我知道艾□要他 但他是我的，而我需要他

253
00:17:45,730 --> 00:17:48,420
She's being unreasonable.
她真是不講道理

254
00:17:48,630 --> 00:17:52,070
Joey, there is a reason that Emma loves that stupid penguin so much!
喬伊，艾□愛那個蠢企鵝是有原因的！

255
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:54,330
Oh, don't cover its ears!
喔，不要摀住他的耳朵！

256
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:58,800
It's because it reminds her of her Uncle Joey.
他讓她想起她的喬伊叔叔

257
00:17:59,710 --> 00:18:01,400
- It does? - Yeah.
-真的？ -是的

258
00:18:01,810 --> 00:18:04,570
And I think she really likes him because he smells like you.
而我認為她很喜歡他 是因為他聞起來有你的味道

259
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:06,180
And she.. She loves that.
而她很喜歡那味道的

260
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:07,900
Go figure.
誰知道呢

261
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:13,950
And she's comforted by him because she loves her Uncle Joey so much.
她很喜歡他是因為 她是那麼愛她的喬伊叔叔

262
00:18:14,150 --> 00:18:17,990
- Really? She loves me? - Oh, yeah.
-真的？她愛我？ -喔，是的

263
00:18:18,230 --> 00:18:21,160
But you know what? If you need Huggsy, don't worry.
但是你知道嗎？如果你需要哈吉 沒關係

264
00:18:21,330 --> 00:18:24,530
Emma will totally understand. I won't, but whatever.
艾□會諒解的，我不會 但是那又如何呢

265
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:29,290
Okay, wait a minute, Rach. I mean, if..
好的，等等，瑞秋 我是說如果…

266
00:18:29,470 --> 00:18:33,100
If Huggsy means that much to Emma, then..
如果艾□那麼喜歡哈吉，那麼…

267
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:34,770
Well, she can have him.
嗯，就給她吧

268
00:18:35,180 --> 00:18:37,870
Oh, sweet, I knew Uncle Joey would step up.
喔，親愛的，我就知道喬伊叔叔最好了

269
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:42,040
- Look, Emma. Look who's back. - No, forget it! Forget it! I can't do it!
-瞧，艾□，瞧瞧是誰回來了 -不，算了！算了！我做不到！

270
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:45,150
Are you..? You're gonna take Huggsy away from a little child?
你…你要把哈吉從一個小孩手上搶走？

271
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:47,750
How do you think I got him in the first place?
要不然你認為我當初怎麼拿到哈吉的？

272
00:18:50,990 --> 00:18:55,330
And then it just gobbled up that puke. I mean..
然後他就將吐出來的東西 狼吞虎嚥吃下去，我是說…

273
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:58,260
That was one gross pigeon.
那真是只噁心的鴿子

274
00:18:58,670 --> 00:19:01,960
Oh, man. Why didn't I ask Joey to keep us apart?
天啊，我為什麼不是 請喬伊幫我們分開呢？

275
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:06,740
You throw a meatball in the hallway, we'd be doing it like rabbits right now.
只要在門外丟塊肉 現在我們就在床上打滾了

276
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:10,440
All right, you two. I'm gonna go to the bathroom.
好了，你們兩個，我要去上廁所

277
00:19:10,610 --> 00:19:13,270
I don't want anything going on while I'm gone.
我不希望在我離開時 發生什麼事

278
00:19:13,450 --> 00:19:15,420
Here's a few things you can discuss:
有幾件事你們可以討論

279
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:19,810
Mucus, fungus, and the idea of me and Ross doing it.
黏液、菌類 還有我跟羅斯如何把玩這些東西

280
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:24,790
I've missed you so much.
我真的好想你

281
00:19:24,990 --> 00:19:28,830
I won't ask you to get back together. I know we want different things, but..
我不會要求你復合 我知道我們要的是不同的東西，但…

282
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,590
- Just to be with you one more night. - I want that too.
-只要跟你再共度一晚就好 -我也想要

283
00:19:31,770 --> 00:19:35,930
- But is that gonna make it too hard? - It can't be any harder than this.
-但是那會使事情更困難嗎？ -再也不會比現在更困難了

284
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:40,270
I mean, if I had known the last time I saw you would be the last time, I..
如果我知道上一次見到你 就是最後一次，我…

285
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,430
I would have stopped to memorize your face, the way you moved.
我一定會努力記住你的臉 你的行動

286
00:19:43,610 --> 00:19:45,810
Everything about you.
你的一舉一動

287
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:50,040
If I had known the last time I kissed you would be the last time..
如果我知道上次親吻你 就是最後一次…

288
00:19:50,220 --> 00:19:52,690
I never would have stopped.
我就不會停下來

289
00:19:53,990 --> 00:19:56,510
Kiss him, you fool!
親啊，你這個傻瓜！

290
00:19:57,190 --> 00:19:59,630
- What? - Didn't you hear that speech?
-什麼？ -你沒有聽到他說什麼嗎？

291
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:02,020
If you don't kiss him, then I will.
如果你不親他，讓我來

292
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:05,360
I missed you so much.
我好想你

293
00:20:05,970 --> 00:20:09,560
- I knew you'd be here! - Crap.
-我就知道你在這裡！ -媽的

294
00:20:09,740 --> 00:20:13,570
- Who is this? - My friend Manny.
-他是誰？ -我朋友曼尼

295
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:16,730
I asked him to keep me away from you.
我請他看好我，遠離你

296
00:20:17,380 --> 00:20:21,750
- Hey, that's what I'm doing for Phoebe. - Well, you're not doing a very good job.
-嘿，我也在幫菲比做同樣的事 -那你根本沒做好你的工作

297
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:24,480
- Excuse me? - What's with the kissing?
-什麼？ -親吻是怎麼回事呢？

298
00:20:24,690 --> 00:20:27,210
Hey, at least I knew where my guy was.
嘿，至少我也在現場哪

299
00:20:27,390 --> 00:20:30,550
Yeah, thank God you were here to oversee all the kissing.
是啊，感謝上帝 你在這裡監看他們親吻

300
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:34,220
- You didn't hear the speech. - I've heard the speech.
-你沒有聽到他說的話 -我聽到了

301
00:20:34,430 --> 00:20:36,660
If he knew it was gonna be the last time..
如果他知道那是最後一次…

302
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:39,200
Hey, it was very moving. You're just heartless!
嘿，那很令人感動的 你真是沒心肝！

303
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:41,770
- You're weak! - You're weird!
-你太軟弱了！ -你太奇怪了！

304
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:44,630
Your pants are undone.
你褲子拉鏈沒拉

305
00:20:47,340 --> 00:20:49,430
Where'd they go?
他們呢？

306
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:53,750
- Damn it. - Well, we blew it.
-該死的 -我們搞砸了

307
00:20:53,910 --> 00:20:56,080
I blame myself.
我只能怪我自己

308
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:58,510
And I blame you too.
而我也只能怪你

309
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:08,660
It's been an hour, and not one of my classmates has shown up?
已經一個小時了 而我同學竟然一個都沒來？

310
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:13,660
I tell you, when I actually die, some people are gonna get seriously haunted.
我告訴你，要是我真的死了 有些人一定會被鬼纏死的

311
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:17,240
There you go. Someone came.
來了，有人來了

312
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:19,630
Okay. Okay. I'm gonna go hide.
好了，好了，我要去躲起來了

313
00:21:19,810 --> 00:21:23,260
This is so exciting. My first mourner!
真是緊張，我第一個追悼者！

314
00:21:26,380 --> 00:21:28,710
Hi. Glad you could come.
嗨，很高興你能夠來

315
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:32,480
- Please come in. - Hi. You're Chandler Bing, right?
-請進 -嗨，你是錢德賓嗎？

316
00:21:32,690 --> 00:21:37,090
- I'm Tom Gordon. I was in your class. - Oh, yes. Yes, let me take your coat.
-我是湯姆高登，是你班上的同學 -喔，是的，是的，讓我幫你拿外套

317
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:40,950
Thanks. I'm so sorry about Ross, it's..
謝謝，很難過聽到羅斯的事，真是…

318
00:21:41,130 --> 00:21:43,790
No, at least he died doing what he loved.
沒關係，至少他死時正在做喜歡的事

319
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:46,260
Watching blimps.
看飛船

320
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:54,130
- Who is it? - You know some guy, Tom Gordon?
-那是誰？ -你認識一個叫湯姆高登的嗎？

321
00:21:54,410 --> 00:21:55,770
I don't remember him.
我不記得他了

322
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:59,640
But then again, I touched so many lives.
但是，我啟發過太多人了

323
00:22:01,950 --> 00:22:03,470
So did you know Ross well?
那你跟羅斯很熟嗎？

324
00:22:03,650 --> 00:22:06,810
Actually, I barely knew him. I came because I heard Chandler's news.
事實上我不太認識他 我來是因為聽到錢德的事

325
00:22:06,990 --> 00:22:09,620
Do you know if he's seeing anyone?
你知道他有在跟誰交往嗎？

326
00:22:13,260 --> 00:22:18,320
- Yes, he is. Me. - What? You mean..?
-是的，他有，就是我 -什麼？你是說…

327
00:22:20,630 --> 00:22:25,440
Can I ask you a personal question? How do you shave your beard so close?
我可以問你一個私人問題嗎？ 你是怎麼將鬍子刮得這麼乾淨的？

328
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:28,940
Okay, Tommy! That's enough mourning for you.
好了，湯姆，你哀悼得夠了

329
00:22:29,110 --> 00:22:32,480
Here we go Bye-bye. All right.
走吧，再見，好了

330
00:22:32,650 --> 00:22:36,450
- Hey, listen. Call me. - Okay.
-嘿，聽著，打電話給我 -好的

331
00:22:38,750 --> 00:22:43,550
- I'm dead and no one cares? - I look like a man?
-我死了還沒有人在乎？ -我看起來像男人嗎？

332
00:22:44,020 --> 00:22:46,960
Please, one ridiculous problem at a time.
拜託，一次一個荒謬的問題就好

333
00:22:47,130 --> 00:22:49,890
This isn't ridiculous. Look around, no one's here.
這並不荒謬，瞧瞧四周 根本沒有人來

334
00:22:50,130 --> 00:22:53,830
You gave them one day's notice. Not everyone checks the website every day.
你才通知他們一天而已 又不是每個人天天都上網

335
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:57,490
And Monica, it's probably the way you stand!
還有摩妮卡，或許是你的站像！

336
00:22:58,710 --> 00:23:02,040
I guess you're right. Still, somebody must have seen it.
我猜你說的對 但是，總該要有人看到啊

337
00:23:02,210 --> 00:23:06,240
I went to that school for four years and I didn't have an impact on anyone?
我讀那所學校四年了 而我竟然沒有影響到任何人？

338
00:23:06,410 --> 00:23:09,710
Well, that's not true. You had an impact on me.
嗯，不是那樣的 你有影響到我

339
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:12,580
I mean, it's 15 years later and we're still best friends.
我是說，已經十五年了 而我們依然是最要好的朋友

340
00:23:12,790 --> 00:23:15,480
Doesn't that count for something?
那不算是什麼嗎？

341
00:23:19,430 --> 00:23:22,790
Oh, great, more party boys for Chandler.
太好了，更多狂野男孩來找錢德了

342
00:23:23,030 --> 00:23:26,730
I'm sure it's somebody for you. Now go hide.
我敢說一定是來看你的，去躲起來

343
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:34,070
Hi. I'm here for Ross Geller's memorial service.
嗨，我來參加羅斯蓋勒的追悼會

344
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:38,440
- Kori? Kori Weston? - Yeah.
-可芮？可芮薇絲頓？ -是的

345
00:23:38,950 --> 00:23:41,710
- You look amazing. - And you are?
-你看起來真棒 -你是誰呢？

346
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:45,440
Chandler. Chandler Bing. And I'm not gay. I'm not gay at all.
錢德，錢德賓 而且我不是同志，我一點都不是

347
00:23:45,620 --> 00:23:47,610
You are married, though.
但是你已經結婚了

348
00:23:47,820 --> 00:23:51,020
Don't listen to him. He's in a really bad mood.
別聽他說，他只是心情很差

349
00:23:54,530 --> 00:23:58,090
I can't believe that Ross is gone. It is just so sad.
我不敢相信羅斯已經走了 真是難過

350
00:23:58,330 --> 00:24:00,360
I didn't know Ross and you were so close.
我不知道羅斯跟你很熟

351
00:24:00,570 --> 00:24:04,400
Oh, we weren't. But we had one class together. He was such a great guy.
喔，並沒有，但是我們一起上過一堂課 他是個很棒的人

352
00:24:04,570 --> 00:24:08,130
And he talked so passionately about science.
而且他總是很熱情地討論科學

353
00:24:08,340 --> 00:24:11,940
- I always remembered him. - I'm sure that would mean a lot to him.
-我一直記得他 -我確定這對他的意義深遠

354
00:24:12,110 --> 00:24:13,910
And if heaven has a door..
而且如果天堂有一扇門

355
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:17,880
I'm sure he's pressing his ear up against it and listening intently.
我敢說他一定耳朵貼著門仔細在聽

356
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:23,710
I thought so many times about calling him and asking him out.
我好多次都想打電話約他出去

357
00:24:23,890 --> 00:24:25,760
I guess I really missed my chance.
我想我真的再也沒有機會了

358
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:28,460
No, you didn't!
不，你還有機會！

359
00:24:30,260 --> 00:24:32,890
I'm still alive!
我還活著！

360
00:24:33,870 --> 00:24:35,990
Who did we bury?
那我們埋葬的是誰？

361
00:24:36,840 --> 00:24:39,330
Kori, I know this is a big surprise for you.
可芮，我知道這件事讓你很驚訝

362
00:24:39,540 --> 00:24:43,670
It's a long story. But the things you just said really made my day.
說來話長，但是你剛說的話 讓我這一天變得很美好

363
00:24:43,840 --> 00:24:46,010
The fact that you're here means more to me..
你的到來真是對我意義重大

364
00:24:46,180 --> 00:24:48,910
than if this room were filled with people.
比房間都充滿了人還要好

365
00:24:49,550 --> 00:24:52,040
You sick freak! Who does that?
你這變態的怪物！誰會做這種事？

366
00:24:52,220 --> 00:24:55,020
I can't believe I had a crush on you.
我不敢相信我喜歡過你

367
00:24:59,330 --> 00:25:01,120
Did you hear that?
你們有聽到嗎？

368
00:25:01,290 --> 00:25:04,990
Kori Weston had a crush on me!
可芮薇絲頓喜歡過我！

369
00:25:11,910 --> 00:25:15,340
No, Mom, I am not dead.
沒啦，媽，我沒死

370
00:25:15,780 --> 00:25:19,040
I know it's not something to kid about.
我知道這是不可以開玩笑的

371
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:24,120
It was just a practical joke between Chandler and me, but it's over, okay?
這只是我跟錢德在玩的惡作劇 已經結束了，好嗎？

372
00:25:24,620 --> 00:25:29,390
Actually, no. Even if I had died, you would not be left childless.
事實上不會的，即使我死了 你也不會沒有孩子

373
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:32,850
Monica?
摩妮卡不算嗎？

374
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


375
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
